#subtitle: International relations and dealing with the DDR.

= Foreign Policy

What should our foreign policy priority be?

@fp_menu

- @improve_europe
- @improve_usa
- @improve_east
- @root: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@improve_europe
title: Improve our relations with our <span style="color: #003399;">European</span> allies.
on-arrival: europe_relation += 2

The key to peace in Europe is a rapproachment between the allies and Germany. Therefore, we are continuing to improve relations with the rest of <span style="color: #003399;">Europe</span>.

@improve_usa
title: Improve our relations with the <span style="color: #B31942;">United</span> <span style="color: #0A3161;">States</span>.
on-arrival: usa_relation += 2

We aim to improve relations with the <span style="color: #B31942;">United</span> <span style="color: #0A3161;">States</span> of America.

@improve_east
title: Improve our relations with our <span style="color: #700000;">eastern</span> neighbors.
on-arrival: east_relation += 1; east_relation += 1 if in_grand_coalition == 0

We aim to improve relations with the <span style="color: #700000;">DDR</span> and the rest of the <span style="color: #700000;">eastern</span> block. Hopefully we can convince them of our peaceful intentions. [? if in_grand_coalition : The <span style="color: #000000;">**CDU**</span> and <span style="color: #286fe0;">**CSU**</span> support the Hallstein doctrine and will sabotage our efforts. ?]
